  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "With the last of his strength, Primordial Origin Immortal Venerable painstakingly creates a human path killer move to aid the future development of Heavenly Court. Star Constellation Immortal Venerable stands before his bed for a long time, then says in a hoarse voice that she has thought of the name and will call it Lying in Bed.",
      "chapters": [
        2328
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_primordial_origin_immortal_venerable",
        "fac_heavenly_court",
        "char_star_constellation_immortal_venerable"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Lying in bed can turn the immortal aperture that a Gu Immortal contributed to Heavenly Court into a bed free from calamities and tribulations, and it can also extend their lifespan to a great extent. Back in that era, it was the number one lifespan extension method besides lifespan Gu.",
      "chapters": [
        2328
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "effect",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_gu_immortal",
        "gu_lifespan_gu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Afterwards Star Constellation creates another human path killer move on the foundation of this move, Others Sleep Soundly. Lying in bed and others sleep soundly become the foundation of Heavenly Court’s immortal graveyard. Primordial Origin Immortal Venerable is the creator of qi path and leaves behind countless methods to defend Heavenly Court, including primordial qi wall, lying in bed, and others.",
      "chapters": [
